# Preserve existing work

Leave these in place unless the user explicitly asks to change them:

- `Career/` (untracked job-title packets and life/career notes)
- `Content/` (photos and video)
- `public/`, `css/`, `index-safety.html`, Firebase config
- `Resumes & Cover Letters/` including new `Resumes/` and `Cover Letters/` folders
- Indexed files currently deleted from the working tree under `Resumes & Cover Letters/use/`

Do not restore, move, or delete that unfinished set as a side effect of operating-system work. Founder pivots must preserve it, mark what is superseded, and retarget agents.
